'''Stellingwarfs''' ({{langx|nl|Stellingwerfs}}) is a [[Westphalian language|Westphalian]]{{citation needed|date=December 2023}} and [[Friso-Saxon]]{{citation needed|date=December 2023}} dialect spoken in [[Ooststellingwerf]] and [[Weststellingwerf]] in the Dutch province of [[Friesland]], and also in [[Steenwijkerland]] and [[Westerveld]] in the Dutch province of [[Overijssel]] and [[Drenthe]].

Like [[Het Bildt]] and [[Leeuwarden]], Weststellingwerf and Ooststellingwerf are among the municipalities of Friesland where [[West Frisian language|West Frisian]] is not spoken.

The language was identified by the government of the [[Netherlands]] in 1996 within Low Saxon.<ref name=e25/>

